<title>USA: Marcus unit to manage Hollywood Inn.</title>
<headline>Marcus unit to manage Hollywood Inn.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marcus Hotels and Resorts, a division of Marcus Corp, said Thursday it reached an agreement to manage the Beverly Garland's Holiday Inn of North Hollywood, Calif.</p>
<p>It has been managing the property on an interim basis since May, 1996. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Marcus operates a number of hotels, restaurants and movie theaters.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
